            <note corresp="#d43-f2" n="97" xml:id="d43-f2-content">
                <p>Marginal notation reads: “(I read this addendum to Secretary Morgenthau over the
                    telephone and got his approval of it.)—D[ean] A[cheson]”.</p>
            </note>
